  <li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-0">Notes before you begin</a></li><li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-1">Read the guide</a></li><li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-2">Adding an LDS tiled layer to your map</a></li><li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-3">How to attribute ToitÅ« Te Whenua</a></li><li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-4">Using a custom map projection - NZTM tile set</a></li><li><a data-tag="H2" href="https://www.linz.govt.nz/guidance/data-service/linz-data-service-guide/map-tile-services/using-lds-xyz-services-leaflet#c-0-s-5">Working examples of LDS imagery tile services</a></li></ul>
